#
# Counter-example for math:TensorComputationGraphShape: a math:TensorComputationGraph
# that declares NO math:computationNode. A computation graph whose forward pass is an
# empty expression graph has no operator to apply and is ill-formed. It names its
# architecture through math:architectureOf but omits the required node, so it fails
# ONLY on sh:minCount 1 on math:computationNode. Validation MUST emit
# shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent and NO other finding
# (math:MalformedTensorComputationGraph). Bound by ex:ecTensorGraphNoNode.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:emptyGraph a math:TensorComputationGraph ;
    math:architectureOf ex:emptyNet .

ex:emptyNet a math:LearnedModel .
